<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's Dongbu Group plans merger of two units.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's Dongbu Group plans merger of two units.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Dongbu Group said on Tuesday it would merge two of its member firms, Dongbu Engineering and Construction Co Ltd and Dongbu Corp, as of January 1, 1997.</p>
<p>Dongbu Group said in a statement the planned merger aimed to strengthen the group's competitiveness in overseas markets. It did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Annual turnover of the merged company, to be named Dongbu Corp, is expected to top two trillion won in calendar 1997, it added. Comparable figures for this year were not given.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
</text>
